Text: 3.2. Leveraging Negative Feedback During the model training, irrelevant domains could be top predicted, and regarding them as additional target labels re- sults in wrong conﬁrmation bias [20], which causes incorrect model training. To reduce the side effect, we leverage utter- ances with negative responses in order to discourage the utter- ances’ incorrect predictions.

