Section: 4. HYPOTHESIS RERANKING MODEL
Text: We use hinge loss with margin 0.4 as the loss function. One issue of the hypothesis reranking is that a training ut- terance cannot be used if no ground-truth exist in the top k (5) predictions of the shortlister. This is problematic in the multi- label PU setting since correct domains can indeed exist in the top k list but unknown, which makes the training utterance less useful in the reranking. Our pseudo labeling method can address this issue.

